From fcf5578f91b6d8226a6f793c90f2dca1f2ea1d8a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Parthiban Nallathambi <parthiban@linumiz.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 23:31:55 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] v850: Return from RH850 interrupt handlers with eiret

RETI does not exist on RH850. Return with EIRET, or FERET for FE level
handlers, in libgcc and in generated handlers, save the interrupt state
they need and describe their frames in the call frame information.

Signed-off-by: Parthiban Nallathambi <parthiban@linumiz.com>
